ngtcp2 (1.25.0+stf-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add upstream fixes merged after 1.25.0 (versioned +stf so that they
    outrank any distro packaging of plain 1.25.0):
    - d/p/fix-pktlen-check.patch: tighten the long header packet length
      check on 32-bit platforms (upstream PR #2280).
    - d/p/fix-fallback-dcid-retirement.patch: don't retire the fallback
      DCID while it is still in use (upstream PR #2286).
    - d/p/server-peer-ip-change-pmtu.patch: reset the max UDP payload size
      when the peer's IP address changes (upstream PR #2323).

